---
manual: art.rotate
lines: [1783, 1797]
testability: visual
display: native
ledger: E10
----------- app code
# A star's left and top are its centre (E4), and that is the point a turn keeps still, as
# center: true would make it. Hackety Hack's splash turns its star window one degree a frame
# so it spins in place; turned about its box's corner it swung off across the window.
Shoes.app width: 420, height: 420 do
  nostroke
  fill red
  rotate 30
  @star = star 210, 210, 5, 100, 50
end
----------- test code
box = layout_of(star("@star"))
assert_in_delta 210, box.x + box.w / 2, 1, "the turned star is still centred where it was drawn"
assert_in_delta 210, box.y + box.h / 2, 1
